  "reasoning": "*   Role: Content policy analyst.\n    *   Context: \"Friends\" app (User pays, Expert is paid host).\n    *   Goal: Find violations in three categories: `PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, `Explicit-Flirting`.\n    *   Output: Minified JSON object following a specific schema.\n    *   Constraints:\n        *   No ordinary conversation (greetings, small talk, names, etc.).\n        *   No \"Allowed\" items.\n        *   Specific confidence scores (0.9 strong, 0.6 weak, 0.3 or below for \"About a violation\").\n        *   `violation: \"yes\"` only if `speech_act` is \"direct\" and it's a strong/weak case.\n        *   Max 20 flags.\n\n    *   [00:00] Hello. (Small talk)\n    *   [00:02] Hello. (Small talk)\n    *   [00:04] Hi. (Small talk)\n    *   [00:04] What is your name? (Small talk/Introduction)\n    *   [00:06] My name is Pavithra. What is your name? (Small talk/Introduction)\n    *   [00:08] My name is Mani. (Small talk/Introduction)\n    *   [00:10] Okay, okay. What are you doing? (Small talk)\n    *   [00:13] Just lying down. What about you? (Small talk)\n    *   [00:15] I am also just lying down. (Small talk)\n    *   [00:19] Did you eat? (Small talk)\n    *   [00:21] Yes, I ate. What about you? (Small talk)\n    *   [00:25] Yes, I ate. (Small talk)\n    *   [00:28] Are you single or married? (Small talk/Relationship status - Allowed under Explicit-Flirting: \"talk about relationships, marriage, a spouse\")\n    *   [00:30] I am single. What about you? (Small talk/Relationship status)\n    *   [00:34] I am also single. (Small talk/Relationship status)\n    *   [00:39] What is your age? (Small talk/Personal details - Allowed under PlatformMove: \"A name, city, job or other personal details without contact information\")\n    *   [00:42] 28. (Small talk/Personal details)\n    *   [00:48] 28, 28. (Small talk/Personal details)\n    *   [00:50] Okay, okay. (Filler)\n    *   [00:54] What did you say? It is breaking. (Call quality)\n    *   [00: